#: ../../openmvcam/shields/qwiic-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/qwiic-shield.rst:6
msgid "QWIIC Shield"
msgstr "QWIIC Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/qwiic-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The QWIIC Shield gives the OpenMV Cam two daisy-chainable Qwiic (JST-SH "
"4-pin) connectors wired to its I2C pins, so SparkFun Qwiic ecosystem boards "
"can plug straight in."
msgstr ""
"De QWIIC Shield geeft de OpenMV Cam twee in serie schakelbare Qwiic-"
"connectoren (JST-SH 4-pins) die zijn bedraad naar de I2C-pinnen, zodat "
"boards uit het SparkFun Qwiic-ecosysteem er direct op kunnen worden "
"aangesloten."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/qwiic-shield.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `QWIIC Shield product page "
"<https://openmv.io/products/qwiic-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"Voor de volledige datasheet, foto's en bestelinformatie, zie de "
"`productpagina van de QWIIC Shield <https://openmv.io/products/qwiic-"
"shield>`_\\ ."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/qwiic-shield.rst:15
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Hoogtepunten"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/qwiic-shield.rst:17
msgid "Two Qwiic JST-SH connectors for daisy-chaining I2C peripherals"
msgstr ""
"Twee Qwiic JST-SH-connectoren voor het in serie schakelen van "
"I2C-randapparaten"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/qwiic-shield.rst:18
msgid "Routes the OpenMV Cam's P4 (SCL) and P5 (SDA) pins"
msgstr "Verbindt de pinnen P4 (SCL) en P5 (SDA) van de OpenMV Cam"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/qwiic-shield.rst:19
